{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"01M6S09BX5DDBXFS8D3EQZG0QR"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$ref":"01M6S74NR7A4V4WTMJDPX6WZHY"},"understandings":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NR7A4V4WTMJDPX6WZHY"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR8VPC39J45ABEVGPPX"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NR9X39EE6GR8EBBEZFP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRAKW6Y40K4SRG0DBRS"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRB95YH86J8AVJ6GVRB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRCJJBQK54VJNTACRJE"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRD41QKYC3YCVWZ2ZA5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRET4Z122KJ4B3RPH25"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRFFG0V731FBHA53RKR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRG5CC9WDV1M0XBYCN9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRHBGCN0A5670R2A32B"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRJXZQ0X7MP6ZJ5PJK0"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRKEWRJVBEZMWQKM96W"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRMW5T6M00S38RTZKSR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRN25XGS7D31AEADZ5D"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRP5WQN4YTXS8PAZVS1"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRQE7XAZXYQEHQG9RZT"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRR65VPCS9V1EZ7RWDH"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRSY1CZXAA9Z5WBVEMD"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRTY95Q89M45KVEHPG0"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRVFC8N7C2ERHTE4D5B"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRWF25JPST33TXEHBJ9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRXZ191CZKS5YF8Y7VV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRYQZV3JRGVC8NXX0K1"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRZG81TCHB09GXD17YW"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS00T5J83SYQP13GZ5Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS10NCDCH9VPPBAAGKX"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS2SCCKS0H0DJP6FJZ5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS3H8BHWKMFX1C9859X"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS4SQ2K28Y62MX650QZ"}]},"id":"01M6S74NS51QN9Z0KXPGD5FM0K","instance":["01M6S74NG0JR8Q2S499AF7FR71"],"kind":"version","name":"branch-09","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how a part stays itself while acting in a whole","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NR8VPC39J45ABEVGPPX"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRFFG0V731FBHA53RKR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRMW5T6M00S38RTZKSR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRSY1CZXAA9Z5WBVEMD"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRXZ191CZKS5YF8Y7VV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS00T5J83SYQP13GZ5Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS4SQ2K28Y62MX650QZ"}],"prose":"The held space is about parts that keep their own meaning and their own judgement and must still act as one. It answers twice: meaning is agreed locally and briefly where parts meet, while authority quietly gathers in a single coordinating holon at the top.","title":"Own sense, one act"},"id":"01M6S74NR7A4V4WTMJDPX6WZHY","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where meaning is kept and who shares it","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NR9X39EE6GR8EBBEZFP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRAKW6Y40K4SRG0DBRS"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRB95YH86J8AVJ6GVRB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRET4Z122KJ4B3RPH25"}],"prose":"Under nearly every proposal lies one move: put knowledge into an explicit structure of concepts so a holon can interpret what reaches it. Comprehension is treated as the precondition for every other capability.","title":"Meaning as the ground"},"id":"01M6S74NR8VPC39J45ABEVGPPX","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"turning data into situational knowledge","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"},{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0943RC500MSJR3TQ6FQP3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0944TNASX9K8JK5V5RTRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"}],"prose":"A prior dictionary of understanding seeds the whole idea of holons that comprehend, and returns as the understanding holon that fuses scattered data into knowledge of a situation.","title":"The dictionary of understanding"},"id":"01M6S74NR9X39EE6GR8EBBEZFP","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a value can be written down as structure","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BX3RAPV03PXJHMR2Z5K"}],"prose":"Ethics, fairness and comprehension are all to be realised the same way, as concepts written into an ontology that a decision can be checked against. Different virtues share a single kind of machinery.","title":"One mechanism under many virtues"},"id":"01M6S74NRAKW6Y40K4SRG0DBRS","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how long an agreement on meaning must last","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NRCJJBQK54VJNTACRJE"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRD41QKYC3YCVWZ2ZA5"}],"prose":"Instead of one lasting shared vocabulary, parts make small temporary vocabularies for a task or an episode and drop them afterwards. Meaning becomes a contract with a lifetime.","title":"Agreements that expire"},"id":"01M6S74NRB95YH86J8AVJ6GVRB","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what a stranger needs to be understood","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09654M23DFDXTHS52MBXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"}],"prose":"A newcomer finds, reads and speaks with the others at the moment it joins, with no prior agreement, by building or aligning a vocabulary on the spot.","title":"Discovery at arrival"},"id":"01M6S74NRCJJBQK54VJNTACRJE","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"coexistence of several states of meaning","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S097JQCMENMDG4DXR4V4ZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0992KZHB02ZBDX260T244"}],"prose":"Short-lived ontologies act as temporary semantic contracts, versioned and mapped across states, letting different kinds of holons negotiate priorities without a global ontology.","title":"Contracts of meaning"},"id":"01M6S74NRD41QKYC3YCVWZ2ZA5","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the amount of common structure imposed","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095PBA4ZRBXY1GY14VWHR"},{"$ref":"01M6S095Q6V5YHG5EJ40PT2KHP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S096NJ1YCGW3GT69CTCK3B"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"},{"$ref":"01M6S099046TN4NZCBCFH60P0M"}],"prose":"Three ways to make systems interoperate differ in what they force everyone to hold in common: one format, one shared layer, or nothing fixed at all. The federated way is chosen because it asks for the least.","title":"How much must be shared"},"id":"01M6S74NRET4Z122KJ4B3RPH25","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a quality is a trait or a part","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NRG5CC9WDV1M0XBYCN9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRHBGCN0A5670R2A32B"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRJXZQ0X7MP6ZJ5PJK0"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRKEWRJVBEZMWQKM96W"}],"prose":"Ethical, effective, understanding, unbiased and vigilant are not offered as properties of every holon but as kinds of holon, separate parts that carry one quality each for the rest.","title":"Qualities become organs"},"id":"01M6S74NRFFG0V731FBHA53RKR","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which deficit each kind is cast against","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0912JT6RA5BZ9DA4QWXW0"},{"$ref":"01M6S091HFR7QY67Y0XKA5J0DF"},{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S093679WVYX9W76WMQSFYF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093JWWSFCKGZGR3EF21M7"},{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"}],"prose":"Every proposed kind of holon is the mirror of one named shortfall of autonomous systems: brittleness, bias, moral blindness, shallow context, poor shared awareness.","title":"Each organ answers a lack"},"id":"01M6S74NRG5CC9WDV1M0XBYCN9","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction evaluations flow","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094Z5HFC2AJXX9P288K6H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953C5H9DMB8CRTPS6YK3"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"}],"prose":"The kinds pass judgements among themselves: checks of fairness and safety flow to the one that weighs short against long term, comprehension feeds both, and vigilance watches across all levels.","title":"Organs consult each other"},"id":"01M6S74NRHBGCN0A5670R2A32B","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the job a quality is assigned when built","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0974ESZ3BC4PQGRAQ140D"},{"$ref":"01M6S0976Z3XG1JS1A2VTTTBZN"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S097ZEDYHSVRT1CRE7YFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0981VVD99XQ72EV84VJE6"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"}],"prose":"Once placed inside the coordinating holon and the mobility system, each quality takes on an operational job: the unbiased one becomes storage and translation of messages, the vigilant one becomes the orchestrator, the understanding one faces the traveller.","title":"Organs recast as jobs"},"id":"01M6S74NRJXZQ0X7MP6ZJ5PJK0","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what remains undefined","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093FSPTEATFTYCNEJEMQ4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093NFQRR88X9PD990GSFB"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S094K282XW4C3DANB6FYG7"},{"$ref":"01M6S094XMKX1YC7SH2K1A4ZDZ"}],"prose":"Each quality stops at the same wall: its guidelines, its metric, its ontology or its detector has not been defined, and is deferred to future algorithms.","title":"What cannot yet be specified"},"id":"01M6S74NRKEWRJVBEZMWQKM96W","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where a decision finally sits","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NRN25XGS7D31AEADZ5D"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRP5WQN4YTXS8PAZVS1"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRQE7XAZXYQEHQG9RZT"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRR65VPCS9V1EZ7RWDH"}],"prose":"Holons are said to keep local autonomy without central control, yet the system repeatedly places one holon above the others with the highest authority. The holarchy leans back toward a pyramid at its apex.","title":"Autonomy and the pyramid"},"id":"01M6S74NRMW5T6M00S38RTZKSR","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"scope set by level","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZT4PVPYCGQYJV7PR3M5"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"}],"prose":"A holon is whole and part at once, and its reach is set by where it sits in the nesting; this is what separates it from a free agent.","title":"Constrained by position"},"id":"01M6S74NRN25XGS7D31AEADZ5D","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"who can rearrange the others","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"}],"prose":"The coordinating holon is the superholon with highest authority, its orchestrator likely a language model that reasons and picks tools, able to restructure workflows and the holons themselves.","title":"The holon that directs"},"id":"01M6S74NRP5WQN4YTXS8PAZVS1","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the boundary coordination does not cross","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"},{"$ref":"01M6S095WN23Y8DRJGK8C24NJV"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"}],"prose":"Against that, the coordination is described as never reaching into a holon's internal logic: each keeps its representations and decisions, and coordination happens only between them.","title":"Autonomy kept inside"},"id":"01M6S74NRQE7XAZXYQEHQG9RZT","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the domains the form has entered","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08YR2M952H7ZN6R90BBJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S08YV85BZVM4G694CQKMYX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090806VNZVA97AV0V0XD2"},{"$ref":"01M6S090GX8FSDRJ0E4TJ1H3DX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090KZCM15DWJFKQVKT5TM"},{"$ref":"01M6S090PDBF0YZFN6YMV9WJ5W"}],"prose":"The nested form moved from a philosophical idea into manufacturing control and then to grids, construction and cyber-physical systems, each time to escape central control.","title":"Where the form has travelled"},"id":"01M6S74NRR65VPCS9V1EZ7RWDH","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the relation between a thing and its copy","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NRTY95Q89M45KVEHPG0"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRVFC8N7C2ERHTE4D5B"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRWF25JPST33TXEHBJ9"}],"prose":"The system is paired with copies of itself, digital twins of the physical and simulation federates of the holons, and the copies are allowed to steer what they copy.","title":"The system with a double"},"id":"01M6S74NRSY1CZXAA9Z5WBVEMD","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of direction over the run","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091PP1ZZQG6WZ7R3BMA7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S091YM28K8SWNXGQD94QWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S092KE6ZMECGQSSQBF90BV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092MRCB5DHW2QJWZCMH6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S092NT1X7H7BGXEJM161WB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092PS96FXNTYW0G07YCMZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S092QP2J2DR6DJZ6E197EW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RHVP4CPW8DAZR8Q3QP"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RXW7KF4BQKGGRPEJTG"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BPKS0KGT7SR4GE75ACB"}],"prose":"Simulation with agents is carried over to holons and graded by how much the holons steer the run, from passive sources of data to rewriting the rules and goals of the simulation.","title":"From taking part to directing"},"id":"01M6S74NRTY95Q89M45KVEHPG0","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"keeping the copy synchronised and honest","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09AH0YMYNDBY3FA44T68F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH1PWXPQSYN6X82S0CZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B0KJPXKB931FZC1JHE3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B4PEE2MM0G40XAMDENJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"}],"prose":"In the case, each holon gets a federate version connected back to it, managed by a reduced copy of the coordinating holon; discrepancies are flagged upward and results invalidated.","title":"Federates as twins of holons"},"id":"01M6S74NRVFC8N7C2ERHTE4D5B","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"freshness of data reaching a holon","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZXGVT2TSASGV9X2TYHX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0916BHS51YPSAGK594MMT"},{"$ref":"01M6S0919HQTTW5K4S0JD9BAN6"},{"$ref":"01M6S091CAZDYVGXTAQ2RARAAA"},{"$ref":"01M6S091KTFAT80JBWTQHERM05"},{"$ref":"01M6S092TSGGXA8WG36SRK5TND"},{"$ref":"01M6S092WW0PH5GJ4A54XXD3EV"}],"prose":"Digital twins and learning at the edge supply the continuous data that lets holons decide locally and reconfigure without a central collector.","title":"Live feed from the physical"},"id":"01M6S74NRWF25JPST33TXEHBJ9","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"when a commitment is made","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NRB95YH86J8AVJ6GVRB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRYQZV3JRGVC8NXX0K1"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NRZG81TCHB09GXD17YW"},{"$ref":"01M6S096H49RY8HY208YF1QTMF"}],"prose":"Almost every commitment is moved from design time to the moment of use: links, vocabularies, workflows and roles are formed when needed and undone when not.","title":"Deciding at runtime"},"id":"01M6S74NRXZ191CZKS5YF8Y7VV","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what is discoverable and composable","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0982Y69VFJ6C8NQBP89NE"},{"$ref":"01M6S098BNS851MZHX3SFT2NYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"},{"$ref":"01M6S098FH9YH6FMBTFF272DJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S098GRA69D8E61BGJ3ETJF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098HDWNMXMGHDKP7HYH0G"},{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"}],"prose":"The coordinating holon keeps a graph of every element's capabilities, finds elements in it and composes workflows from them, with generation and execution removable for less autonomy.","title":"A graph of what can be done"},"id":"01M6S74NRYQZV3JRGVC8NXX0K1","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the kinds of mediation needed","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"},{"$ref":"01M6S097VCBK9XZ25KFJF0ND5N"},{"$ref":"01M6S098Q89NK293FCZ3EYNTNC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098WFFJ09R57JCXQAZAM3"}],"prose":"Its work is translating, aligning goals, gathering data, arbitrating conflicts and reshaping roles, all while running.","title":"Five acts of mediation"},"id":"01M6S74NRZG81TCHB09GXD17YW","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what is missing in the territory","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NS10NCDCH9VPPBAAGKX"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS2SCCKS0H0DJP6FJZ5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS3H8BHWKMFX1C9859X"}],"prose":"The rural mobility case tests the whole on sparse territory, where the most distinctive output is not a route but a located gap: places where no transport reaches.","title":"Finding absence on the map"},"id":"01M6S74NS00T5J83SYQP13GZ5Q","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"gaps between demand and service","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099H77DWSEH2T534Q8NP8"},{"$ref":"01M6S099K16DKC7EQQ35ANCYXH"},{"$ref":"01M6S099P1AJBBMKJ6BC76WM36"},{"$ref":"01M6S099QDK964CYS5R06EN4WT"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"}],"prose":"By gathering requests, routes and avoided zones, the system is meant to reveal areas without means of travel and report them to those who could serve them.","title":"Mobility deserts"},"id":"01M6S74NS10NCDCH9VPPBAAGKX","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the order in which roles act","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099RX7Z7ZGC575Z0RX8W5"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2VW9MCRGFVA05NDNK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3PSM31D58SR50QBDQS"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3Q6P77FKPS24YHHCNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5BW0BNN3HVZ12K0BPE"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"}],"prose":"A request passes from the traveller-facing holon through transport and infrastructure holons, via a translating communication holon, to optimised routes returned to the user.","title":"One trip through the roles"},"id":"01M6S74NS2SCCKS0H0DJP6FJZ5","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what is demonstrated and what is hoped","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09BAGXSGTE19VJ36NDS5M"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BD7Q7DNEGX5EB0MJ8HK"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BEWR9X5Z7H9RYYS9WNB"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BKTDMZ0B76G7C8BX946"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BX3RAPV03PXJHMR2Z5K"}],"prose":"Benefits of scale, fairness and lower emissions are claimed, while the closing admits no empirical validation and calls the roles analytical constructs.","title":"Shown versus proposed"},"id":"01M6S74NS3H8BHWKMFX1C9859X","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
